1. Heard Mr. P. Tomcha, learned counsel appearing for the appellants;
Mr. Vijayanand Sharma, learned Sr. PCCG, appearing for the Union of India respondents; Mr. RK Umakanta, learned senior counsel assisted by Mr. W. Niranjit, learned Deputy Government Advocate appearing for the State respondents and Mr. H. Tarunkumar, learned senior counsel Shri Meingamlung Gondaimei And Another vs The State Of Manipur And 7 Others on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/155093707/
1

Prayers in WA No. 32 of 2011 :
"The humble appellant, therefore, prays that the Hon'ble High Court be pleased to :
(1) Admit the present appeal;
Shri Meingamlung Gondaimei And Another vs The State Of Manipur And 7 Others on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/155093707/
2 (2) Call for the records;
(3) after hearing, set aside the impugned order dated 8-4- 2011 passed in Writ Petition No. 82 of 2011, passed by Hon'ble Justice Mr. Ashok Potsangbam,
dismissing the Writ Petition, for the ends of justice and of equity;

The appellant filed the said writ petition before this Court praying as follows :-
"The humble writ petitioner, therefore, pray that the Hon'ble High Court be pleased to :
1. issue a writ of Certiorari to quash the direction of the respondent No. 4 to stop disbursement of compensation amount to the affected persons vide his letter dated 30- 12-2008 in Annexure-A/4, for the ends of justice and of equity;
2. issue a writ of Certiorari to quash the order/memorandum dated 13 October, 2009,
(Annexure- A/5) of the respondent No. 2, thereby cancelling/dropping the Award bearing No.DC(TML) 11/370(Railway)08 (Pt.2) dated 28.11.2008 (Annexure- A/1), for the ends of justice and of equity;
4. issue a writ of Mandamus to direct the respondent No. 2 to make a reference under Section 18 of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894, as demanded by the writ petitioners in their representation dated 15-1- 2010(Annexure-A/6), for the ends of justice and of equity;
Shri Meingamlung Gondaimei And Another vs The State Of Manipur And 7 Others on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/155093707/
4 5.
